<title>ISRAEL: Israel posts 389 mln shekel surplus in July.</title>
<headline>Israel posts 389 mln shekel surplus in July.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel posted a budget surplus of 389 million shekels in July, according to preliminary figures released by the Treasury on Sunday.</p>
<p>			 July 1997    June 1997   Year-to-date</p>
<p> Budget balance     +  389	-3,136	 -4,233</p>
<p> Expenditures	 11,219	12,457	 81,037</p>
<p> Receipts	     11,608	 9,602	 76,804</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in millions of shekels.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.54 shekels)</p>
<p>-Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502</p>
</text>
